    "referenceSolution": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <set>\n#include <map>\n#include <queue>\n#include <deque>\n#include <stack>\n#include <numeric>\n#include <functional>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <climits>\n#include <utility>\nusing namespace std;\nint main(){string s,t;getline(cin,s);for(char c:s){if(c>='A'&&c<='Z')t+=c-'A'+'a';else if((c>='a'&&c<='z')||(c>='0'&&c<='9'))t+=c;}string r=t;reverse(r.begin(),r.end());cout<<(r==t?\"YES\":\"NO\")<<'\\n';}\n",
